    {
      "subId": "1110305",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Xiao",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "111030501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "111030501": {
            "id": "111030501",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Have you gathered the items for the ritual?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030502"
            ]
          },
          "111030502": {
            "id": "111030502",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Hmm... This censer, and these lamps... Their designs are flawless, almost as if they were made specifically for use in the adepti arts. Where did you come by them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030503"
            ]
          },
          "111030503": {
            "id": "111030503",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We got them from a yaksha named Pervases...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030504"
            ]
          },
          "111030504": {
            "id": "111030504",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh! And um, he says hi!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030505"
            ]
          },
          "111030505": {
            "id": "111030505",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Pervases...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030506"
            ]
          },
          "111030506": {
            "id": "111030506",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "...Yes, this does have the hallmarks of something Pervases might do.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030507"
            ]
          },
          "111030507": {
            "id": "111030507",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "As I thought, it seems that he could not leave Liyue behind either... I hope that its present state will allow him to rest in peace.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030508"
            ]
          },
          "111030508": {
            "id": "111030508",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Well then. Let us begin preparing for the ritual.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030509"
            ]
          },
          "111030509": {
            "id": "111030509",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Place the censer in the middle, and surround it with the Seven-Star Lamps. Adorn the area with the items of abject cold. Once this is done, we shall proceed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030510"
            ]
          },
          "111030510": {
            "id": "111030510",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Yes, this will do. Now, the next step is the key to performing Dream Trawler...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030511"
            ]
          },
          "111030511": {
            "id": "111030511",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "There are four steps to performing this ritual: offering incense, meditation, incantation, and loosing an arrow.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030512"
            ]
          },
          "111030512": {
            "id": "111030512",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ah... Seems like a real rigmarole.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030513"
            ]
          },
          "111030513": {
            "id": "111030513",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Adepti arts are the product of millennia of study by adepti. Do not dismiss their mystical workings as \"rigmarole.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030514"
            ]
          },
          "111030514": {
            "id": "111030514",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Failure to take this seriously could cause the technique to devour one's own body, or cause the spirit to be sundered from one's flesh permanently...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030515"
            ]
          },
          "111030515": {
            "id": "111030515",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Agh! Stop talking! Paimon's sorry!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030516"
            ]
          },
          "111030516": {
            "id": "111030516",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "When offering the incense, we place the incense into the censer with reverence for Rex Lapis in our hearts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030517"
            ]
          },
          "111030517": {
            "id": "111030517",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Meditation is to empty ourselves of trivial thoughts, and to focus on the target of the art we are performing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030518"
            ]
          },
          "111030518": {
            "id": "111030518",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Then, we shall recite the incantation in a loud voice: \"Devayaksha, Bring Forth Sin!\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030519"
            ]
          },
          "111030519": {
            "id": "111030519",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "Finally, we will loose an arrow towards each of the yaksha statues to enlist their authority for our contract.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030520"
            ]
          },
          "111030520": {
            "id": "111030520",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "If all goes well, Starsnatcher's soul will be brought forth shortly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030523"
            ]
          },
          "111030523": {
            "id": "111030523",
            "speakerId": 10204,
            "speakerName": "Xiao",
            "text": "If you have no other questions, let us begin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "111030524"
            ]
          },
          "111030524": {
            "id": "111030524",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... Well... let's start by offering up incense, shall we? You know, with respect for Rex Lapis and everything..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
